### DynamoDB GSI hash_key/range_key deprecation with key_schema replacement

Source: https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/main/internal/service/dynamodb/table.go

Within global_secondary_index blocks, hash_key (line 190-196) and range_key (line 231-236) are deprecated in favor of key_schema (line 197-215). Top-level table hash_key (line 267-272) is NOT deprecated. The docs at dynamodb_table.html.markdown:406-412 confirm: 'Mutually exclusive with key_schema. Use key_schema instead.' Caveat: This deprecation applies ONLY to GSI key definitions — the top-level table primary key still uses hash_key/range_key directly.

```go
"hash_key": {
    Type:         schema.TypeString,
    Optional:     true,
    Computed:     true,
    Deprecated:   "hash_key is deprecated. Use key_schema instead.",
    ValidateFunc: validation.StringIsNotEmpty,
},
"key_schema": {
    Type:     schema.TypeList,
    Optional: true,
    Computed: true,
    Elem: &schema.Resource{
        Schema: map[string]*schema.Schema{
            "attribute_name": {
                Type:         schema.TypeString,
                Required:     true,
                ValidateFunc: validation.StringIsNotEmpty,
            },
            "key_type": {
                Type:             schema.TypeString,
                Required:         true,
                ValidateDiagFunc: enum.Validate[awstypes.KeyType](),
            },
        },
    },
},
"range_key": {
    Type:             schema.TypeString,
    Optional:         true,
    Deprecated:       "range_key is deprecated. Use key_schema instead.",
    ValidateDiagFunc: verify.WarnStringIsNotEmpty,
},
```

